{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45147","headline":"奉送李中丞道昌入朝 · 皎然","name":"奉送李中丞道昌入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文宪中司盛，恩荣外镇崇。\n诸侯皆取则，八使独推功。\n诏喜新衔凤，车看旧饰熊。\n去思今武子，余教昔文翁。\n清在如江水，仁留是国风。\n光徵二千石，扫第望司空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}